    },
    "atom::b1b2b4a788459b5a51e65156": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b1b2b4a788459b5a51e65156",
      "source_handle": "P0144",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管ICIs改变了实体瘤的治疗格局，但患者响应率不均且存在耐药性。肿瘤内在机制无法完全解释个体差异。本研究旨在厘清肠道微生物群如何作为“类器官”系统调节宿主免疫从而影响ICI疗效和毒性，并为开发基于微生物群的联合疗法提供理论依据。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::660a40da6b6fd9baeeaa7c45608863a40eecd9c3ed83eca0e91e4177c1e910fd",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::cf729e08d0d66df370023f5409c75b5df165144ef64470fc99b805ac7be2ad7e",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::b64e8231f73616bfd2a80810": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b64e8231f73616bfd2a80810",
      "source_handle": "P0144",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "肠道微生物群（Gut Microbiome）与实体瘤免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs，如PD-1/PD-L1、CTLA-4阻断剂）疗效及免疫相关不良反应（irAEs）之间的关系。涵盖机制研究（细菌菌株、代谢物、PRR信号）、临床关联数据及转化策略（FMT）。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::660a40da6b6fd9baeeaa7c45608863a40eecd9c3ed83eca0e91e4177c1e910fd",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::aff13e7670ac87bd7ab6342a09273029a00eff364170e883944c022e075c0cd7",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::b68c8ed6f12e1aedb57b11ad": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b68c8ed6f12e1aedb57b11ad",
      "source_handle": "P0144",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本文是一篇综述，旨在总结肠道微生物群影响ICIs疗效和毒性的现有机制证据，并探讨靶向微生物群的潜在治疗策略。文章首先阐述了肠道作为免疫界面的解剖学和生理学基础，随后详细讨论了特定有益菌属（如Akkermansia muciniphila、Bacteroides）及其代谢产物（短链脂肪酸SCFAs、肌苷、色氨酸代谢物）如何通过调节先天性和适应性免疫反应来增强抗肿瘤免疫。此外，文章分析了微生物群通过肠-肺轴等途径参与irAEs（特别是结肠炎和肺炎）的机制，并重点评估了粪便微生物移植（FMT）在治疗难治性ICI相关结肠炎中的临床应用现状、疗效、安全性及局限性。最后，文章指出了当前研究在标准化和可重复性方面的不足，并提出了未来结合多组学和人工智能进行精准医疗的方向。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::660a40da6b6fd9baeeaa7c45608863a40eecd9c3ed83eca0e91e4177c1e910fd",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::6caf294ec9080344bf65f070384447976a814eb0ce26699e356079db0de5ceff",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::f6cfa8f1718457540b5b627f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f6cfa8f1718457540b5b627f",
      "source_handle": "P0144",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述为理解肠道微生物群如何调节ICI疗效提供了全面的机制框架，特别适用于回答“微生物群如何影响ICI疗效”及其背后的生物学路径。它提供了从分子机制（代谢物、PRR）到临床表型（响应率、irAEs）的多层次证据，并引入了FMT作为潜在的转化手段。其价值在于梳理了复杂的互作网络，并明确了当前证据的强弱分布（如Akkermansia证据较强，Bacteroides较弱），有助于综述作者区分确证性结论与假设性机制。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::660a40da6b6fd9baeeaa7c45608863a40eecd9c3ed83eca0e91e4177c1e910fd",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::9a1492262faa2d6ee61bdc4889236fa0c298059cc2dc2424b9d7d3a0f8feb3be",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::8eb717837768e243082daa6d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8eb717837768e243082daa6d",
      "source_handle": "P0144",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "临床关联多为观察性研究，因果链条在人类中尚未完全确立；不同癌症类型的结果可能存在异质性。",
        "contribution": "提供了肠道微生物群影响ICI疗效的临床关联证据和机制假说。具体包括：指出Akkermansia丰度与响应正相关，Bacteroides关联复杂，Alpha多样性具有预测潜力但非唯一指标。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::660a40da6b6fd9baeeaa7c45608863a40eecd9c3ed83eca0e91e4177c1e910fd",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::178b52a66c197f4a779bdd77938708ef26a8fa680b8b03abc8cc07ab57251e1f",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::cdeb979890af77c2f7195f2a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::cdeb979890af77c2f7195f2a",
      "source_handle": "P0144",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "可用于论证微生物群组成是ICI疗效的重要决定因素，并列举具体的微生物标志物。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::660a40da6b6fd9baeeaa7c45608863a40eecd9c3ed83eca0e91e4177c1e910fd",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
