      "value": "review",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::2982acd184049ed5bf73367d1e56cb56bfcf761c3939d1e15a0f3babd76b4ce8",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::b108064ede6712f9e766ace8d39a3f7b19bba3048d6628f37ab8aea8eb7325db",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::f326f83d4b0a4f3c8c3150eda44b36c58a3bc9c7dd2784ba3b9d44f3a759d015",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::2827d99d3dcf98657562d9b2": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2827d99d3dcf98657562d9b2",
      "source_handle": "P0387",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管ICI疗法改变了部分实体瘤的治疗格局，但其对“冷”肿瘤或无响应患者的效果有限。本研究旨在解决如何安全有效地将微生物疗法作为ICI的辅助手段，以扩大受益人群并克服耐药性问题。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::2982acd184049ed5bf73367d1e56cb56bfcf761c3939d1e15a0f3babd76b4ce8",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::b108064ede6712f9e766ace8d39a3f7b19bba3048d6628f37ab8aea8eb7325db",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::c89eb50c33384b9fe070286e7d7d442117cd4ae5cc80aac44968042fad75fff5",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::897420d152a1f4691a65b58e": {
      "atom_id": "atom::897420d152a1f4691a65b58e",
      "source_handle": "P0387",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "固体肿瘤患者中，肠道微生物群作为免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）辅助治疗的临床前与临床研究现状。涵盖益生菌、微生物菌群组合及粪便微生物移植（FMT）三种主要干预手段。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::2982acd184049ed5bf73367d1e56cb56bfcf761c3939d1e15a0f3babd76b4ce8",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::b108064ede6712f9e766ace8d39a3f7b19bba3048d6628f37ab8aea8eb7325db",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::1333f64a863847314d8399cab66b43aa0509b139f068f8f453803040d41a2640",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::10082b6cc311135dbfe6dcf1": {
      "atom_id": "atom::10082b6cc311135dbfe6dcf1",
      "source_handle": "P0387",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本文是一篇综述，旨在评估通过调节肠道微生物群来增强固体肿瘤免疫治疗疗效的潜力。文章系统回顾了基于单菌株/有限混合物的益生菌（如CBM588、EDP1503）、多菌株微生物菌群组合（如MET4、SER-401、VE800）以及全环境粪便微生物移植（FMT）在联合ICI治疗中的临床试验结果。研究重点分析了不同干预策略在客观缓解率（ORR）、无进展生存期（mPFS）及安全性方面的表现，并探讨了从动物模型到人体转化的挑战、监管障碍、患者招募困难以及现有机制理解的局限性。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::2982acd184049ed5bf73367d1e56cb56bfcf761c3939d1e15a0f3babd76b4ce8",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::b108064ede6712f9e766ace8d39a3f7b19bba3048d6628f37ab8aea8eb7325db",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e23b025c45dda0cff69904e21b350784c03b5d9de6504d55743c2177d63921a4",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::18d8941896b4f3c3c2d26dcc": {
      "atom_id": "atom::18d8941896b4f3c3c2d26dcc",
      "source_handle": "P0387",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述为回答“肠道微生物如何调节ICI疗效”提供了关键的临床分层视角。它不侧重于单一机制的深度解析，而是通过对比三类不同复杂度的微生物干预措施（益生菌vs菌群组合vs FMT）的临床结局，揭示了“微生物复杂性/多样性”与“治疗效果”之间的潜在正相关关系。这对于解释为何某些简单补充剂失败而FMT成功具有重要参考价值，并为后续探讨机制提供了临床现象层面的约束条件。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::2982acd184049ed5bf73367d1e56cb56bfcf761c3939d1e15a0f3babd76b4ce8",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::b108064ede6712f9e766ace8d39a3f7b19bba3048d6628f37ab8aea8eb7325db",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3b064c343100f048d8dee1fbb348682362aea313fb4439eb640fc0955cf9f460",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::3a7be2d0ab0883257f020f7a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::3a7be2d0ab0883257f020f7a",
      "source_handle": "P0387",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "这些数据来自小样本早期临床试验，存在选择偏倚和统计效力不足的问题。不能据此断定某种特定菌株在所有情况下均有效或无效。",
        "contribution": "提供了三类微生物干预策略在多种实体瘤中与ICI联用的临床疗效对比数据。具体而言，指出FMT在多种难治性肿瘤中表现出较一致的ORR提升（20-77%），而益生菌和菌群组合的效果则呈现高度的癌种特异性和菌株依赖性（如CBM588在mRCC有效但在MSS CRC无效，VE800整体无效）。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::2982acd184049ed5bf73367d1e56cb56bfcf761c3939d1e15a0f3babd76b4ce8",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::b108064ede6712f9e766ace8d39a3f7b19bba3048d6628f37ab8aea8eb7325db",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a76f48be571492603627d2558434e5ae4580745b9ed55b7c5fa63d9a3e11e511",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::7bdd61ac9f222ca4ae63b23d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::7bdd61ac9f222ca4ae63b23d",
      "source_handle": "P0387",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于回答“肠道微生物如何调节ICI疗效”中的效应大小和一致性部分。可作为证据说明：微生物疗法的疗效并非普适，而是依赖于干预措施的复杂度（全菌群vs单一菌）及肿瘤类型。可用于支持“微生物组成多样性对疗效至关重要”的论点。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::2982acd184049ed5bf73367d1e56cb56bfcf761c3939d1e15a0f3babd76b4ce8",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::b108064ede6712f9e766ace8d39a3f7b19bba3048d6628f37ab8aea8eb7325db",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7dbc88c59944f9ad3daf25769722edc03ab3ef35646292caa6d0450095f936fa",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::e7a08fe8d3267d2e0ff0d6a1": {
      "atom_id": "atom::e7a08fe8d3267d2e0ff0d6a1",
      "source_handle": "P0387",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "机制描述多为相关性观察或基于动物模型的推测，文中明确承认“大部分未知”。不能将这些关联视为已证实的因果机制。",
        "contribution": "讨论了微生物调节ICI疗效的可能机制线索，包括T细胞浸润增加、抗原呈递细胞（APCs）积累、IL-8产生髓系细胞减少以及短链脂肪酸（SCFAs）等代谢物的作用。同时指出目前缺乏单一因果物种的证据，倾向于网络效应和功能冗余。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::2982acd184049ed5bf73367d1e56cb56bfcf761c3939d1e15a0f3babd76b4ce8",
