          "record_id": "record::66afcfe719fb8b5ee6396eb3d1f93774bc27ac52eb7cff82eb027967c13b7fbb",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "paper_kind"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::311ac7fc7e2262a60d1790ffd0c73f18e0348127afeaef95dc93b98ec0e646d0",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::bf1d46b1c9816d089c247528": {
      "atom_id": "atom::bf1d46b1c9816d089c247528",
      "source_handle": "P0470",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管临床前和临床研究提示特定细菌类群可能影响ICIs的疗效和irAEs，但这些关联的幅度和一致性尚不明确。本研究旨在量化肠道微生物群组成及其调控对ICIs治疗疗效和毒性谱的具体影响。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::66afcfe719fb8b5ee6396eb3d1f93774bc27ac52eb7cff82eb027967c13b7fbb",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::7a1fd713668f9a035bf3b0e745f11c9f7d71631ec95274f115e1433c962dee02",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::2f51eb111c2ace15d2475862": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2f51eb111c2ace15d2475862",
      "source_handle": "P0470",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "癌症患者（特别是接受免疫检查点抑制剂治疗的患者）的肠道微生物群组成、干预措施及其与疗效和不良事件的关系。涵盖的研究类型包括观察性研究（基线菌群、抗生素暴露）、干预性研究（FMT、益生菌/益生元）。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::66afcfe719fb8b5ee6396eb3d1f93774bc27ac52eb7cff82eb027967c13b7fbb",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::353cc37618a5eafc59b84cfe5c2b1162f234232151a47be81d8d2541d487e31c",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::8bd32a4a71acaf80a8edd654": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8bd32a4a71acaf80a8edd654",
      "source_handle": "P0470",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文是一篇系统综述和荟萃分析，旨在评估肠道微生物群对免疫检查点抑制剂（ICIs）疗效及免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）的影响。作者通过系统检索PubMed、Embase、Web of Science和Cochrane Library数据库（截至2025年3月），纳入了38项涉及5,642名患者的研究。研究重点分析了特定细菌属（如Akkermansia muciniphila、Bifidobacterium longum、Faecalibacterium prausnitzii）的富集、抗生素使用、供体反应者粪便微生物移植（FMT）以及微生物多样性指数与总生存期（OS）、无进展生存期（PFS）、客观缓解率（ORR）及irAEs之间的关联。结果显示，有益菌富集与改善生存预后显著相关，而抗生素暴露则与较差的生存结果相关，FMT从反应者来源可显著提高缓解率。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::66afcfe719fb8b5ee6396eb3d1f93774bc27ac52eb7cff82eb027967c13b7fbb",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::56ecb78eedcf545496f8913049f62e7afac5081df7ee3f49ff8e6a449c563c7d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::22e47bea47aa73c571249184": {
      "atom_id": "atom::22e47bea47aa73c571249184",
      "source_handle": "P0470",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述提供了肠道微生物群作为ICIs疗效生物标志物和干预靶点的宏观定量证据。其核心价值在于汇总了特定有益菌、抗生素负面影响及FMT正面效果的效应量，为解释“微生物群如何调节疗效”提供了流行病学层面的支持，并指出了潜在的干预方向。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::66afcfe719fb8b5ee6396eb3d1f93774bc27ac52eb7cff82eb027967c13b7fbb",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::0c9fb1ea59355ed9e301bdfe5552b0d8771114f7f81444e0dd711476a67ffe59",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::4d515e81ecce4092cc77829d": {
      "atom_id": "atom::4d515e81ecce4092cc77829d",
      "source_handle": "P0470",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "仅展示关联，不直接提供分子机制；未区分不同肿瘤类型间的差异；未提供irAEs的具体效应量数据。",
        "contribution": "提供了特定细菌属（Akkermansia, Bifidobacterium, Faecalibacterium）富集与ICIs疗效提升（OS, PFS）的正向关联证据；提供了抗生素暴露与疗效下降的负向关联证据；提供了FMT提高ORR的证据。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::66afcfe719fb8b5ee6396eb3d1f93774bc27ac52eb7cff82eb027967c13b7fbb",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::92f070a3e9fcbb2eb6c65376bfa35c9fc65e38c8546aea7ca919f1df26c192fc",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::0a7c067232247a76ac3426a7": {
      "atom_id": "atom::0a7c067232247a76ac3426a7",
      "source_handle": "P0470",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于回答“肠道微生物群如何调节ICIs疗效”中的相关性部分，证明特定微生物特征与临床结局的统计学联系。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::66afcfe719fb8b5ee6396eb3d1f93774bc27ac52eb7cff82eb027967c13b7fbb",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "0",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::8c9fbd9c44d4f246683a46a7f060e2edb71b17fce92f91b67a3c406e28e267f0",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::6b402a143e9e52a21f1a8a4b": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6b402a143e9e52a21f1a8a4b",
      "source_handle": "P0470",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "本综述本身未深入阐述具体的分子或细胞机制（如抗原呈递、T细胞浸润等），因此不能直接用于回答机制问题，只能作为机制研究的动机或验证目标。",
        "contribution": "虽然主要关注临床结局关联，但通过指出特定菌属和多样性的作用，间接指向了可能的机制路径（如免疫激活）。",
        "facet_id": "F2"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::66afcfe719fb8b5ee6396eb3d1f93774bc27ac52eb7cff82eb027967c13b7fbb",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::92f070a3e9fcbb2eb6c65376bfa35c9fc65e38c8546aea7ca919f1df26c192fc",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
