    "atom::f1aa6ce49462b4fc36bf4e98": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f1aa6ce49462b4fc36bf4e98",
      "source_handle": "P0462",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "problem_or_question"
      ],
      "value": "尽管已知肠道微生物组影响ICI的初始疗效和irAEs，但其对长期生存获益的具体影响及底层机制（如代谢物、分子模拟、菌株变异）尚不清楚。特别是区分长期获益者与耐药者或仅发生irAE者的微生物特征差异。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::51342908369a3d1c46566ac349d7838235724e931a9dbba397c30430387a91e3",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::59aab1e2a170fac4e9fc15c61d0812e90cfed356cae053ebe34124e25d62e1c0",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::0e9c11fd9439a46e9f2334bc36382b22b11433c9e90450fdc345a4fe5df000b4",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "problem_or_question"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::9a3bd5ed35e10575f27738e7dc2e109e37570c9df6e0f3874cfa60df3b8592ab",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::8723f2c5d07d798f6a11ec0f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8723f2c5d07d798f6a11ec0f",
      "source_handle": "P0462",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "research_scope"
      ],
      "value": "中国北京协和医院晚期非小细胞肺癌（NSCLC）患者，接受抗PD-1/PD-L1免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）治疗。研究聚焦于基线肠道微生物组与代谢组特征对长期疗效（无进展生存期PFI≥1年）及免疫相关不良事件（irAEs）的影响。样本分为长期获益组、严重irAE组和耐药组，并通过外部公共队列（McCulloch, Routy等）进行验证。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::51342908369a3d1c46566ac349d7838235724e931a9dbba397c30430387a91e3",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::59aab1e2a170fac4e9fc15c61d0812e90cfed356cae053ebe34124e25d62e1c0",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::0e9c11fd9439a46e9f2334bc36382b22b11433c9e90450fdc345a4fe5df000b4",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "research_scope"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::0063ee54dae6c8435fa2a79a98773d15bbbe38d0a4a6d2b513d40d095aa1ded6",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::6739f5f8fdd552af3ccd0592": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6739f5f8fdd552af3ccd0592",
      "source_handle": "P0462",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "work_summary"
      ],
      "value": "本研究旨在阐明肠道微生物组如何影响肺癌患者ICI治疗的长期结局及其潜在机制。通过前瞻性收集基线粪便样本进行宏基因组和代谢组测序，结合临床随访数据，分析微生物组成、短链脂肪酸（SCFA）水平、分子模拟现象及菌株变异与临床表型的关系。研究发现，长期获益患者拥有更紧凑的微生物网络和高产丁酸/丙酸的能力；irAE患者的微生物中存在与自身免疫抗原相似的表位；响应患者的微生物中富含与肺癌抗原相似的表位；且特定物种（如大肠杆菌和普拉梭菌）的菌株水平变异与临床表型显著相关。这些发现为“智能”粪菌移植提供了理论依据。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::51342908369a3d1c46566ac349d7838235724e931a9dbba397c30430387a91e3",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::59aab1e2a170fac4e9fc15c61d0812e90cfed356cae053ebe34124e25d62e1c0",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::0e9c11fd9439a46e9f2334bc36382b22b11433c9e90450fdc345a4fe5df000b4",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "work_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::a651f8a3212e4d5e794b91fb818874607d72a397a12360aaaeb7d1fed0fb06c3",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::af5711e6c5f6068b2280c330": {
      "atom_id": "atom::af5711e6c5f6068b2280c330",
      "source_handle": "P0462",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该论文为综述提供了关于肠道微生物组调节ICI疗效和irAEs的多维度机制证据，特别是从代谢产物（SCFAs）、分子模拟（抗原交叉反应）和菌株特异性三个层面。其价值在于将宏观的菌群组成差异细化到具体的代谢通路、抗原表位匹配和微观的基因组变异，为解释“为何某些菌群有益而另一些有害”提供了具体机制素材，并提出了“智能FMT”的概念框架。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::51342908369a3d1c46566ac349d7838235724e931a9dbba397c30430387a91e3",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::59aab1e2a170fac4e9fc15c61d0812e90cfed356cae053ebe34124e25d62e1c0",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        },
        {
          "record_id": "record::0e9c11fd9439a46e9f2334bc36382b22b11433c9e90450fdc345a4fe5df000b4",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::e3f5a369330422cd4542af6d4c043cdcc5a1377a4554ee5344ab623865cdde53",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::1853254a590326de7a98b136": {
      "atom_id": "atom::1853254a590326de7a98b136",
      "source_handle": "P0462",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions"
      ],
      "value": {
        "boundaries": "数据主要来自肺癌患者，虽在黑色素瘤队列中验证了丙酸/丁酸趋势，但需注意肿瘤类型的异质性。关联性强，但因果链条需结合其他干预研究理解。",
        "contribution": "提供了SCFAs（乙酸、丙酸、丁酸）作为预测ICI长期疗效的生物标志物的实证数据。具体指出丁酸生产依赖乙酰辅酶A途径，且高水平SCFA与延长PFS和降低进展风险相关。",
        "facet_id": "F1"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::51342908369a3d1c46566ac349d7838235724e931a9dbba397c30430387a91e3",
