    "atom::5a6cec745bdbbb96061f2d7a": {
      "atom_id": "atom::5a6cec745bdbbb96061f2d7a",
      "source_handle": "P0028",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "approach"
      ],
      "value": "采用叙事性综述方法。作者通过梳理文献，从三个维度组织材料：(1) CRC免疫微环境的构成与空间分布；(2) 微生物组对免疫系统的作用机制（PRRs激活、代谢物调节、抗原呈递）与免疫系统对微生物组的反馈调节（IgA、细胞因子、PD-1）；(3) 微生物异质性与治疗反应性的关联，以及基于此的靶向干预策略（工程菌、代谢物补充、FMT、联合疗法）。文中引用了多项体外实验、动物模型研究及部分临床试验数据作为论据支持。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e27d1d80c8c6c9f4ae73314bd22ff0935a8d3123315c96a88d1ffa23e65098de",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "approach"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::8e54a9dd99ca31f3eb436e2f89537df08476496e022afb52fb04a37288e9f3d7",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::210e5d2f07c93b43ec367efb": {
      "atom_id": "atom::210e5d2f07c93b43ec367efb",
      "source_handle": "P0028",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "提供了CRC中微生物-免疫双向调控的系统性框架，整合了从分子机制（TLR4, AhR, IDO1）到临床表型（免疫沙漠vs炎症型）的多层次证据。",
        "limits": "作为综述，其结论依赖于所引用的原始研究，部分机制主要基于动物模型或回顾性分析，缺乏大规模前瞻性随机对照试验的直接证据来确立因果关系。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e27d1d80c8c6c9f4ae73314bd22ff0935a8d3123315c96a88d1ffa23e65098de",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2eb94a49ca80df6b50f676cb36bf883160153155db9bec544825d3dc5dc7690d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::8d9679d9a46d7d46637259e7": {
      "atom_id": "atom::8d9679d9a46d7d46637259e7",
      "source_handle": "P0028",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "明确了特定微生物标志物（如Fn/Fp比值）和治疗相关微生物（如产丁酸菌、B. fragilis）作为预测免疫治疗和化疗疗效的生物标记物的潜力。",
        "limits": "关于微生物异质性的时空差异及其对个体化治疗的精确指导意义，目前仍停留在概念层面，缺乏标准化的检测流程和临床验证标准。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e27d1d80c8c6c9f4ae73314bd22ff0935a8d3123315c96a88d1ffa23e65098de",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2eb94a49ca80df6b50f676cb36bf883160153155db9bec544825d3dc5dc7690d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::06e3870d7f02968c8d88c04c": {
      "atom_id": "atom::06e3870d7f02968c8d88c04c",
      "source_handle": "P0028",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "contribution_and_limits"
      ],
      "value": {
        "contribution": "总结了多种靶向干预策略（FMT、工程菌、代谢物补充），指出了当前转化的瓶颈（如供体匹配、载体安全性、伦理监管）。",
        "limits": "大多数干预措施仍处于临床前阶段或早期临床试验阶段，长期安全性和有效性尚未得到广泛证实，且不同研究间的干预方案差异巨大，难以直接比较。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e27d1d80c8c6c9f4ae73314bd22ff0935a8d3123315c96a88d1ffa23e65098de",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "contribution_and_limits",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::2eb94a49ca80df6b50f676cb36bf883160153155db9bec544825d3dc5dc7690d",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::2cefaaf0e8ae5bbac1b597e1": {
      "atom_id": "atom::2cefaaf0e8ae5bbac1b597e1",
      "source_handle": "P0028",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "微生物通过TLR4/NLRP3通路及代谢物（NaB）",
        "finding": "微生物可促进或抑制免疫反应。例如，TLR4激活可增强T细胞浸润或抑制肿瘤形成（取决于模型）；NaB通过抑制HDAC促进Treg增殖并抑制Th17分化，发挥抗炎作用。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e27d1d80c8c6c9f4ae73314bd22ff0935a8d3123315c96a88d1ffa23e65098de",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3f19a41afd66e01b7fa7fc8a9395a219e06185da74907c3ae69477203042d3ec",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::fc4803ce7ded366b232efc6f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::fc4803ce7ded366b232efc6f",
      "source_handle": "P0028",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "特定微生物代谢物（如Fn来源的琥珀酸、B. fragilis多糖）",
        "finding": "不同微生物对免疫治疗响应有差异化影响。Fn及其代谢物琥珀酸通过抑制cGAS-IFN-β通路导致抗PD-1耐药；而B. fragilis多糖可与CTLA-4抑制剂协同增强T细胞活化。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e27d1d80c8c6c9f4ae73314bd22ff0935a8d3123315c96a88d1ffa23e65098de",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3f19a41afd66e01b7fa7fc8a9395a219e06185da74907c3ae69477203042d3ec",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::c74364048e9e293f7951aa75": {
      "atom_id": "atom::c74364048e9e293f7951aa75",
      "source_handle": "P0028",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "IDO1/Kyn/AhR信号轴",
        "finding": "微生物代谢物（如吲哚-3-羧酸）可通过调节IDO1-Kyn-AhR通路抑制Treg分化，增强CD8+ T细胞功能，从而提升抗PD-1疗效。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e27d1d80c8c6c9f4ae73314bd22ff0935a8d3123315c96a88d1ffa23e65098de",
          "field_path": [
            "study_summary_A",
            "key_findings",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::3f19a41afd66e01b7fa7fc8a9395a219e06185da74907c3ae69477203042d3ec",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::89868760174da92467c74427": {
      "atom_id": "atom::89868760174da92467c74427",
      "source_handle": "P0028",
      "field_path": [
        "study_summary_A",
        "key_findings"
      ],
      "value": {
        "conditions": "工程菌与纳米递送系统",
        "finding": "工程益生菌（如表达IL-15/FLT3L或硒纳米颗粒的大肠杆菌Nissle 1917）可在动物模型中显著增强抗肿瘤免疫，但面临定植率低、生物安全性未明及缺乏临床验证等限制。"
      },
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
