    "atom::b3d5e92e7f86e850e3e5d445": {
      "atom_id": "atom::b3d5e92e7f86e850e3e5d445",
      "source_handle": "P0028",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "facet_contributions",
        "possible_uses"
      ],
      "value": "用于讨论“未来方向”或“干预策略”，展示如何通过调节微生物组来改善ICI疗效，为综述提供临床转化的视角。",
      "role": "planning",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e27d1d80c8c6c9f4ae73314bd22ff0935a8d3123315c96a88d1ffa23e65098de",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "facet_contributions",
            "2",
            "possible_uses"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::83b18fbaf6e5d1fe25e58b8ef55b51cee36f7c797328590591f39a7a5e655142",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::f6ecdb6f850b81eabd967759": {
      "atom_id": "atom::f6ecdb6f850b81eabd967759",
      "source_handle": "P0028",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "planning_summary"
      ],
      "value": "该综述为理解肠道微生物组如何调节实体瘤（特别是CRC）中的免疫检查点抑制剂（ICI）疗效提供了详细的机制背景和潜在 biomarkers。它详细阐述了微生物通过代谢物（如琥珀酸、短链脂肪酸）和抗原呈递影响T细胞功能和耗竭的具体路径，并列举了导致ICI耐药或增敏的关键微生物种类。这对于回答“微生物如何调节ICI疗效”及其“介导机制”具有直接的素材价值。",
      "role": "planner_interpretation",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e27d1d80c8c6c9f4ae73314bd22ff0935a8d3123315c96a88d1ffa23e65098de",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "planning_summary"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::1aed1311b8bdce3d71acf3273a69a356f285aa0dca77275da7f70efd97af4f59",
      "multiple_values_in_field": false
    },
    "atom::03a9dd8d7e1e346260686ba8": {
      "atom_id": "atom::03a9dd8d7e1e346260686ba8",
      "source_handle": "P0028",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "该综述主要聚焦于结直肠癌（CRC），虽然提及黑色素瘤作为PD-1研究的参考，但其核心数据和机制推导均基于CRC。在推广到其他实体瘤时需格外谨慎。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e27d1d80c8c6c9f4ae73314bd22ff0935a8d3123315c96a88d1ffa23e65098de",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "0"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::c6e55b63ba3b8b265bac84599d574cda4a5eed1ec64dcb2d4f9a4d4e1de655fd",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::6f04c00c6d39995005013387": {
      "atom_id": "atom::6f04c00c6d39995005013387",
      "source_handle": "P0028",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "文中提到的许多机制（如TLR4、NLRP3、AhR）在不同微生物和不同癌症类型中可能有不同的作用方向，不能简单地将CRC中的发现外推至所有情况。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e27d1d80c8c6c9f4ae73314bd22ff0935a8d3123315c96a88d1ffa23e65098de",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "1"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::c6e55b63ba3b8b265bac84599d574cda4a5eed1ec64dcb2d4f9a4d4e1de655fd",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::5bba9c7c5d19a04f6e6645fd": {
      "atom_id": "atom::5bba9c7c5d19a04f6e6645fd",
      "source_handle": "P0028",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "对于“工程菌”和“纳米递送”等干预措施，目前证据等级较低，主要为动物实验，不应将其视为已成熟的临床解决方案。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
        {
          "record_id": "record::e27d1d80c8c6c9f4ae73314bd22ff0935a8d3123315c96a88d1ffa23e65098de",
          "field_path": [
            "review_planning_B",
            "scope_interpretation_cautions",
            "2"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "variant_group": "field::c6e55b63ba3b8b265bac84599d574cda4a5eed1ec64dcb2d4f9a4d4e1de655fd",
      "multiple_values_in_field": true
    },
    "atom::57d746f0637f29f51cc5d18f": {
      "atom_id": "atom::57d746f0637f29f51cc5d18f",
      "source_handle": "P0028",
      "field_path": [
        "review_planning_B",
        "scope_interpretation_cautions"
      ],
      "value": "微生物与免疫治疗的关联多为相关性研究，部分因果证据来自动物模型，需注意区分观察性关联与因果机制。",
      "role": "evidence",
      "origins": [
